    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your home from zombies in between taking bathroom breaks and watching tv. Be Human... Or Die trying is a 1-8 player online co-op defense game where killing zombies is just as important as taking a shower. Also did I mention that you play an alien in a mech suit? Yeah it's a weird game like that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>What Do You Do in This Game?</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill zombies to defend your home</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of your human needs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Understand humans by living like them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy way to much stuff from the online company Amazomb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange the furniture in your house</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
